{:event/type "kanban.comment", :event/id "kanban-knoxx-translation-resource-locale-filter-options-1792059088819", :event/time "2026-10-15T10:11:28.819Z", :session/id "kanban", :delivery/mode "tell", :payload {:task-id "knoxx-translation-resource-locale-filter-options", :text "Planning refinement for native PR16 review 5531333989 on 7e7af709cac6b996f7df3a842cf949356eebb853: all six findings were verified against the existing frontend logic/controller/view and shared fixture helper. Refine only this 3-point breakdown card body and verification: explicitly own the shared helper's opt-in es/fr/nl scenario while preserving default 18 rows; define exact locale ordering; reset All and immediately hide installed old-project manifest/resource options; assert the existing successful filter-change GET baseline; use nl outside the historical fallback for causal unavailable-manifest coverage. No application source/test/fixture implementation, ready transition, runtime rebuild, model/content/review/publication effect or CI waiver is admitted by this planning refinement. Draft SHA256 a2288993471240d1a2c0dfd20301ea40b24b113ae455a2f8f0ea4590da33e2df. Existing source-family Sandbox SDK failure and observed private browser failures/502 limits remain visible.", :source "cli", :agent "eta-mu", :write-id "1792059088816-0.nj0z2j6gyviu8xq1q7b", :type "comment"}, :causal/root "8c8581e8-63c0-4fd1-84b5-0df1161b45fb"}
